  "scope": [
    "six typed requests, exact names and canonical deduplicated order",
    "one-based selection from supplied real K-A record stream",
    "rule/returned-control/TOP-frame classifier; pending frames do not classify current operation",
    "typed operation/binding and node data, separate plan types and shared manifest association",
    "plan identity over supplied canonical body without own ID; artifact hash over complete emitted bytes",
    "two planned artifact formats, located Unsupported others, declared capability flags and unchanged supplied application object",
    "current checked-failure binding preserves source/value/error_code under CheckedU128Result; old missing-value fallback retained historically; operand-aware equality labels follow 3bb404f15"
  ],
  "remainingObligations": [
    "Prove exact Rust record-stream selection, classifier and typed-binding projection correspondence and actual operand-sort projection.",
    "Current source ArenaRead input descriptors include control/environment while outputs can name captured-frame operands; prove full-state reconstruction, restored environments and executable witness/constraint semantics rather than infer them from labels or sample values.",
    "Prove actual canonical JSON omission/encoding, SHA implementation and identifier bindings; no global hash injectivity or distinct-ID theorem is asserted.",
    "Prove dependency references, unique IDs, stable topological order, coverage of every required operation/component/omission, and slot/lifetime correctness for real plans.",
    "Prove request parser/normalization and file-emission correspondence. Actual IO failures can leave already-written artifacts; no atomic multi-file or rollback guarantee is claimed.",
    "Prove CLI normalization/file emission binding to the selected-record API; the newer S9 union U031 holdout is pending. No independently inspected passing receipt is claimed for that union.",
    "The backend declares field_layouts unsupported and host-u128/1, not a realized Midnight field/circuit exporter. Structured-witness support is a reported capability, not a proof it computes the complete witness.",
    "No source/IR/circuit/native/stock-verifier/ledger acceptance or same-fuel A/B equivalence follows.",
    "At 32fcbce3e error-result shape is repaired, but prove actual KDisplay/error-code encoding and propagation through complete witness/constraint semantics; current operand-aware equality labeling follows 3bb404f15."
  ],
